# Differences from the renderer's own per-character fallback cache, not from
# anything the shim decides.
#
# child_process_sandbox_support_impl_linux.h keys unicode_font_families_ on the
# character alone, with no locale in the key, so the first language to ask a
# character fixes the answer for every later one in that renderer.
#
# writing-system-line-break-001 asks for U+301C under lang=en first, so its
# lang=ja and lang=ja-Hang divs inherit that answer. The `_janghang` page is the
# control: identical in a fresh renderer.
